{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004_03_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3bf446d55f40d76667707ee45a401d81d9c0b5d013098243151e938f373d4c18",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8488a8ca9c4957c1b7975867ce5c7bb43d94242142a0c52f2f7cfdb4e26a9539",
      "text": "……要是叔叔还活着，知道我现在\n在挑战什么的话，一定会大吃一惊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c589ee7551f9c77a75e132b12c427f4eebe1305c503a6650a0a212398942d1fb",
      "text": "其实我打算参加一家叫做315 Production的\n事务所的试镜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd5fa532937621a1922fb707af455b2801033b1ae6182bf8e4372fc67d3f6296",
      "text": "你猜是什么事务所？\n……告诉你吧，是偶像事务所哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:175bd5bc85035cc87fc33570be168e61515ecfdbf1c3084af4b062d58aa2d22c",
      "text": "不敢相信吧？\n要是了解以前的我，这根本就是天方夜谭对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:241f5e95f895e65af7f3a331e63fe11d5f960b9a0f627c62e043ce62dc101fcc",
      "text": "……那个四处惹事生非的“茨城鬼神”，\n竟然想要去当偶像什么的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3eab322b2a06c1e76ea42fd24bdaf9685563deeb3c001546aea5a5d5b798237f",
      "text": "你觉得呢，叔叔。吓了一跳吗？\n还是说，会像往常那样对我微笑呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd20c8eed12e205b717615c9822e49ec3a869b56184d1dca0cf6310f56dabc72",
      "text": "会在繁花簇拥之下，温柔地为我送行吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aac0aed4b41ccebfa68fc51ad34c7f2302b14c94be664a248194c0cefd8090d6",
      "text": "如果你问我：“为什么要当偶像呢？”的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8525b9a225ba941e90e984899ec422c99b7dc351e67effae59da8f0fee12f0e",
      "text": "我想和叔叔聊的事，可多着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
